;TYPE:Custom
; filament end gcode 
;M106 P3 S0
; === IdeaFormer IR3 V2 Belt Printer End ===
M400 ; wait for moves to finish
G28 X ; home X axis
M104 S0 ; heater off
M140 S0 ; bed off
G92 E0 ; zero extruder
G1 E-5 F300 ; retract 5mm
M73 P97 R0
G4 P7000 ; wait 7s for ooze
G28 ; home all
G1 Y50 F1000 ; lift nozzle 50mm
M73 P99 R0
FMS_off ; filament motion sensor off
BED_MESH_CLEAR
M84 ; disable motors
M73 P100 R0
